WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:01.200
Buenas noches.

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.680
By the way, I've got excellent

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.560
sound proofing, if you catch my drift.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.840
You seem way too excited

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.040
about that soundproof comment.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.840
You act like a teenager.

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.440
Listen, I'm here only to deal

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.800
with my business affairs.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.480
You were on top of your game today.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.280
Is that your favorite position?

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.440
Stop it.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:34.880
What kind of impression

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.720
would we make?

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.680
So be a good girl.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.320
No investment on earth

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.000
could make me lie down for you.
